From 7d28b4508b8a2870d852bf1477875325f5e19ad1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rigaz29 <ryanbagas27@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 04:50:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] core: kembalikan RecoveryDefaultTouchRotation yang hilang
 saat rebase 24.0

Empat target build.prop gagal begini:

  FAILED: .../build/soong/system-build.prop/android_common/build.prop
  gen_build_prop.py, line 452, in append_additional_vendor_props
  KeyError: 'RecoveryDefaultTouchRotation'

Konsumennya ada, produsennya tidak. gen_build_prop.py membaca dua kunci
bersaudara:

  449  if config["RecoveryDefaultRotation"]:      -> ro.minui.default_rotation
  452  if config["RecoveryDefaultTouchRotation"]: -> ro.minui.default_touch_rotation

sementara soong_extra_config.mk hanya memancarkan yang pertama, sehingga
product_config.json berisi RecoveryDefaultRotation, RecoveryOverscanPercent
dan RecoveryPixelFormat, tanpa RecoveryDefaultTouchRotation.

Kedua paruh tambalan LineageOS ini tinggal di repo berbeda -- konsumennya di
build/soong, produsennya di build/make -- dan hanya satu yang ikut terbawa ke
24.0. Dibandingkan dengan lineage-23.2:

  23.2 core/soong_extra_config.mk:50  RecoveryDefaultRotation
  23.2 core/soong_extra_config.mk:51  RecoveryDefaultTouchRotation
  24.0 core/soong_extra_config.mk:48  RecoveryDefaultRotation
  24.0                                (barisnya hilang)

Sedangkan gen_build_prop.py 23.2 baris 441-442 identik dengan 24.0 baris
452-453, jadi yang berubah memang cuma sisi build/make.

Barisnya dikembalikan persis seperti di 23.2, di antara kedua tetangganya.
A37 tidak menyetel TARGET_RECOVERY_DEFAULT_TOUCH_ROTATION, jadi nilainya
kosong dan gen_build_prop melewatinya -- yang penting kuncinya ada.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 core/soong_extra_config.mk | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/core/soong_extra_config.mk b/core/soong_extra_config.mk
index 03fcc961dd..574e3c86f3 100644
--- a/core/soong_extra_config.mk
+++ b/core/soong_extra_config.mk
@@ -46,6 +46,7 @@ $(call add_json_str, SystemServerCompilerFilter, $(PRODUCT_SYSTEM_SERVER_COMPILE
 $(call add_json_bool, Product16KDeveloperOption, $(filter true,$(PRODUCT_16K_DEVELOPER_OPTION)))
 
 $(call add_json_str, RecoveryDefaultRotation, $(TARGET_RECOVERY_DEFAULT_ROTATION))
+$(call add_json_str, RecoveryDefaultTouchRotation, $(TARGET_RECOVERY_DEFAULT_TOUCH_ROTATION))
 $(call add_json_str, RecoveryOverscanPercent, $(TARGET_RECOVERY_OVERSCAN_PERCENT))
 $(call add_json_str, RecoveryPixelFormat, $(TARGET_RECOVERY_PIXEL_FORMAT))
 ifdef TARGET_RECOVERY_NO_INITIAL_MODSET_FLUSH
